A. Commit message:
libfs: Backport patch to use d_children list for iterating simple_offset directories

B. Change summary:
Backported the changes from the newer version to the older version of fs/libfs.c. The key modifications include updating the directory iteration logic to leverage the d_children list maintained by the dcache instead of relying solely on mtree offsets. Adjusted function signatures and logic to ensure compatibility with the older codebase while preserving the functionality improvements.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Medium

